    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Bryan Mercado",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116854952889116449187/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-YxjALHRywBx7j7C5uYfZDZ-errNHf1PipjhcaV5tOC6Ehw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Reggie and the whole team are highly professional and honest. They take the time to explain the issue clearly and are very accommodating, even on short notice. They fixed my 2018 Mitsubishi Outlander quickly and did and excellent job. Highly recommended!",
        "time": 1755207359,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Maxim Lanciu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117338179095605628409/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI1ky8Rf7u6VbDP1MG5S_w6e_A0murUdMWTea17TikQieq7YQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I have had an engine problem and honestly after visiting two auto garages, I thought it is irreparable or it will cost me a lot of money replacing completely the engine. Thanks God I was recommended Reggie who is specialized on Honda and Acura for more than 30 years.\nIt was my first time coming there, but it was undoubtedly the best service I’ve ever had for my car.\nFirst, I had an immediate appointment. Second, I was welcomed with very kind and hearty people, making me fill like a family member. Finally, Reggie, his sons and the whole staff did an extremely awesome, professional, fast and very reasonable priced work repairing the engine of my car, that two garages before couldn’t fix it. Furthermore, all works are very transparent, so you can track all the steps of the repairing. But seriously, they did much much more work. When I opened the hood, I couldn’t believe my eyes the engine was like new, everything was cleaned, even battery, all tubes, all connections, everything wow!!! Nowadays it's hard to find honest, hardworking, dedicated people like Reggie! I will definitely be back and I highly recommend “Island Boyz Performance” for your general and specialized maintenance needs!  I assure you your car will be in good hands.\nReggie thank you heartily. I wish you all the best!",
        "time": 1645203297,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Richard Portelance",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102240716730087771174/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKwrrfgoDwnQ8iSFW6umSwf-hYp-PYHQdXW78S1pISZQ3G3lA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Had to fix and replace major component of the AC system on my 1987 Chevy camaro a car I’ve had for about 20 years now and which is dear to me. Staff and mechanics handled it like professional. While they seem to be more specialized in Honda products, they will tackle everything big or small. They did a fantastic job in mine.",
        "time": 1655379845,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jon Nuguid",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103203364705042058326/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJzZbh0yZTMUNgZKpSh32iInUte5LxUTWdTZDI26CYbfdtAeA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Reggie as well as his sons are professionals who offer an amazing service. If you have any issues with your vehicle, I highly recommend Island Boyz Performance 🚘\nCheck them out !!!",
        "time": 1748970927,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jim Dolbel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115941824534827471505/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL7CbNdjguv2el2AwYRcASy4jiDsiLxuKHrECtckQrOdJZ_2Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I called 1st time , they squeezed me in, installed my Borla exhaust.\nReggie & Matthew were so friendly, professional and trustworthy that I will recommend them to family & friends.\nWent to get my exhaust installed and came away with 2 New Friends.\nThanks so much.",
